      "statement": "Tagging failures are fatal per-file: struct.error from piexif.dump/insert and OSError or piexif.InvalidImageDataError from piexif.load are logged and re-raised by add_relative_path_tag, so a tagging failure counts as a file failure in the run summary rather than being ignored.",
