      "statement": "In --dry-run mode process_image simulates the metadata steps without modification: it opens the source file, calls get_exif_orientation, and logs 'Would rotate image <path> by <angle> degrees' (or 'No rotation needed'); it also logs the would-be RelativePath tag only for .jpg/.jpeg destinations, while a failure to open the source is logged as a warning, not a counted failure.",
