    {
      "id": "claim_c317d759dab64619a1ba779b45e41214",
      "statement": "Within process_image the EXIF work follows a fixed order on the destination copy — get_date_taken on the source, shutil.copy2 to the output folder (preserving EXIF), then rotate_image_according_to_exif on the copy, then add_relative_path_tag on the copy — so the source tree is never mutated and the tag is written onto the already-rotated file.",
